RJ Tech preview 1.1.0-preview.1 (2026-10-11) reorganizes the two trees,
updates acquisition and developer documentation, adds a development manual
and automated software checks, supplies an independent ROS 1 driver guide,
identifies B draft limitations, and defaults B YAML/launch to simulation.

Upstream package metadata remains 1.1.0. No physical vehicle validation or
manufacturer approval of draft interfaces is claimed.
The public source manifest identifies the original downloadable packages.
